  "title": "PA Ratings — Create / Edit",
  "entity": "HCMv3.PerformanceManagement.PARating",
  "overviewHtml": "<p>A rating reviewers can give, with the score range it stands for.</p><p>Its <strong>Code</strong> is its value: the scorecard averages the codes of the ratings given, so codes should be numbers, with the best rating highest. The <strong>From</strong> and <strong>To</strong> range bands a final score into this rating on the scorecard and manager evaluation reports.</p>",
